==Battleground==
*4 [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dagshund]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**6 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
**2 [[Madam Peng]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The enemies don't push all too hard, so you can build up a giant stack of [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cats]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]] on the Dagshund given you meatshield well. If you've collected the [[Legendary Cat Sword|Sword]] and [[Legendary Cat Shield|Shield]] [[Treasure]]s from [[Empire of Cats]], this should be a breeze.

